{"seq":1,"slug":"knowledge-graph-applications","title":"知识图谱应用工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/applications/knowledge-graph-applications","wordCount":978,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识图谱应用工程\">知识图谱应用工程</h1><p>知识图谱将现实世界的实体和关系以图结构存储，是企业智能化的重要基础设施。从搜索引擎的知识卡片，到问答系统的语义理解，再到 LLM 的事实增强，知识图谱的工程实现都建立在图数据库之上。本文系统讲解知识图谱的工程构建流程，从数据建模到查询应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实体（Entity）</td>\n<td>知识图谱中的节点，代表现实世界中可区分的对象（人、地点、组织等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系（Relation）</td>\n<td>实体之间的命名连接，代表语义联系（BORN_IN、WORKS_FOR 等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三元组（Triple）</td>\n<td>知识图谱基本存储单元：（头实体, 关系, 尾实体）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本体（Ontology）</td>\n<td>定义实体类型继承关系和约束规则的元模型（RDFS/OWL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体链接（Entity Linking）</td>\n<td>将文本中的实体提及映射到知识图谱中的规范实体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GraphRAG</td>\n<td>将知识图谱与大语言模型结合的检索增强生成范式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"知识图谱的基本结构\">知识图谱的基本结构</h2><h3 id=\"基本元素\">基本元素</h3><p><strong>实体（Entity）</strong>：知识图谱中的节点，代表现实世界中可以区分的对象。实体有类型（如 Person、Organization、Location）和属性（如 name、birthDate、description）。</p>\n<p><strong>关系（Relation）</strong>：实体之间的命名连接，代表两个实体之间的语义联系。例如「Barack Obama」BORN_IN「Hawaii」。</p>\n<p><strong>三元组（Triple）</strong>：知识图谱的基本存储单元，格式为（主语, 谓词, 宾语）或（头实体, 关系, 尾实体）。</p>\n<p><strong>本体（Ontology）</strong>：定义实体类型的层次结构和关系的约束规则。例如：Employee 是 Person 的子类，WORKS_FOR 关系的主语必须是 Person，宾语必须是 Organization。</p>\n<h3 id=\"知识图谱-schema-设计\">知识图谱 Schema 设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 实体类型（使用多标签表示继承）&#10;// 基础类型&#10;CREATE (p:Entity:Person:Employee {&#10;    id: &#39;person_001&#39;,&#10;    name: &#39;张三&#39;,&#10;    birthDate: date(&#39;1990-05-15&#39;),&#10;    description: &#39;软件工程师，专注于图数据库领域&#39;&#10;})&#10;&#10;CREATE (o:Entity:Organization:Company {&#10;    id: &#39;org_001&#39;,&#10;    name: &#39;字节跳动&#39;,&#10;    founded: date(&#39;2012-03-01&#39;),&#10;    industry: &#39;Internet&#39;,&#10;    headquarters: &#39;Beijing, China&#39;&#10;})&#10;&#10;// 关系（携带时效性和来源信息）&#10;CREATE (p)-[:WORKS_FOR {&#10;    since: date(&#39;2020-06-01&#39;),&#10;    title: &#39;Senior Engineer&#39;,&#10;    source: &#39;LinkedIn&#39;,&#10;    confidence: 0.95&#10;}]-&gt;(o)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 实体类型（使用多标签表示继承）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 基础类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p:Entity:Person:Employee {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id: 'person_001',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: '张三',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    birthDate: date('1990-05-15'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    description: '软件工程师，专注于图数据库领域'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (o:Entity:Organization:Company {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id: 'org_001',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: '字节跳动',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    founded: date('2012-03-01'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    industry: 'Internet',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    headquarters: 'Beijing, China'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 关系（携带时效性和来源信息）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p)-[:WORKS_FOR {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    since: date('2020-06-01'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    title: 'Senior Engineer',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    source: 'LinkedIn',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    confidence: 0.95</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}]->(o)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"知识图谱构建流程\">知识图谱构建流程</h2><h3 id=\"知识抽取管线\">知识抽取管线</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[原始文本/结构化数据] --&gt; B[实体识别\\nNER]&#10;    B --&gt; C[关系抽取\\nRelation Extraction]&#10;    C --&gt; D[实体链接\\nEntity Linking]&#10;    D --&gt; E[知识融合\\nKnowledge Fusion]&#10;    E --&gt; F[图数据库存储]&#10;    F --&gt; G[知识图谱]\">graph LR\n    A[原始文本/结构化数据] --&gt; B[实体识别\\nNER]\n    B --&gt; C[关系抽取\\nRelation Extraction]\n    C --&gt; D[实体链接\\nEntity Linking]\n    D --&gt; E[知识融合\\nKnowledge Fusion]\n    E --&gt; F[图数据库存储]\n    F --&gt; G[知识图谱]</pre><p><strong>实体识别（NER）</strong>：从文本中识别实体提及（mention），标注类型。常用工具：spaCy、Stanford NER、BERT-NER。</p>\n<p><strong>关系抽取（Relation Extraction）</strong>：识别文本中实体间的关系。分为规则方法（正则/依存树模式）和机器学习方法（BERT 分类器）。</p>\n<p><strong>实体链接（Entity Linking）</strong>：将文本中的实体提及与知识图谱中的规范实体对齐。例如：文本中的「苹果公司」→ 知识图谱中的 <code>&lt;http://dbpedia.org/resource/Apple_Inc.&gt;</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 实体链接的基本逻辑（简化示例）&#10;def entity_linking(mention: str, context: str, graph_db) -&gt; Optional[str]:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;将文本提及链接到知识图谱实体&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    # Step 1: 候选生成（字符串相似度匹配）&#10;    candidates = graph_db.run(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        MATCH (e:Entity)&#10;        WHERE e.name CONTAINS $mention&#10;           OR any(alias IN e.aliases WHERE alias CONTAINS $mention)&#10;        RETURN e.id, e.name, e.description&#10;        LIMIT 20&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;, mention=mention)&#10;&#10;    # Step 2: 候选排序（语义相似度）&#10;    # 使用 sentence transformer 计算 context 与候选描述的相似度&#10;    best_match = rank_candidates(candidates, context)&#10;&#10;    return best_match.id if best_match.score &gt; 0.7 else None\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实体链接的基本逻辑（简化示例）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> entity_linking</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mention: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, context: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, graph_db) -> Optional[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"将文本提及链接到知识图谱实体\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Step 1: 候选生成（字符串相似度匹配）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    candidates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph_db.run(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MATCH (e:Entity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHERE e.name CONTAINS $mention</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">           OR any(alias IN e.aliases WHERE alias CONTAINS $mention)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        RETURN e.id, e.name, e.description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        LIMIT 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mention</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mention)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Step 2: 候选排序（语义相似度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 使用 sentence transformer 计算 context 与候选描述的相似度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    best_match </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rank_candidates(candidates, context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_match.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_match.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"知识融合\">知识融合</h3><p>当同一实体在多个数据源中有不同表示时，需要进行<strong>实体对齐（Entity Alignment）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 识别可能是同一实体的节点对&#10;MATCH (a:Person), (b:Person)&#10;WHERE id(a) &lt; id(b)&#10;  AND a.name = b.name&#10;  AND apoc.text.levenshteinSimilarity(&#10;      toString(a.birthDate), toString(b.birthDate)&#10;  ) &gt; 0.8&#10;RETURN a.id, b.id, a.name, a.birthDate, b.birthDate&#10;&#10;-- 合并确认为同一实体的节点（使用 APOC）&#10;CALL apoc.refactor.mergeNodes([nodeA, nodeB], {&#10;    properties: &#39;overwrite&#39;,&#10;    mergeRels: true&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 识别可能是同一实体的节点对</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a:Person), (b:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE id(a) &#x3C; id(b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AND a.name = b.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AND apoc.text.levenshteinSimilarity(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      toString(a.birthDate), toString(b.birthDate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) > 0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN a.id, b.id, a.name, a.birthDate, b.birthDate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 合并确认为同一实体的节点（使用 APOC）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL apoc.refactor.mergeNodes([nodeA, nodeB], {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    properties: 'overwrite',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mergeRels: true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"知识图谱查询模式\">知识图谱查询模式</h2><h3 id=\"实体查找与关系探查\">实体查找与关系探查</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 查找实体及其直接关系（1跳邻域）&#10;MATCH (e:Entity {id: &#39;person_001&#39;})&#10;OPTIONAL MATCH (e)-[r]-&gt;(related)&#10;RETURN e, type(r) AS relType, related&#10;LIMIT 50&#10;&#10;-- 路径查找：两个实体之间的最短路径&#10;MATCH (a:Entity {name: &#39;张三&#39;}), (b:Organization {name: &#39;字节跳动&#39;})&#10;CALL gds.shortestPath.dijkstra.stream(&#39;kg_projection&#39;, {&#10;    sourceNode: a,&#10;    targetNode: b&#10;})&#10;YIELD path&#10;RETURN [n IN nodes(path) | coalesce(n.name, n.title)] AS route,&#10;       length(path) AS hops\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 查找实体及其直接关系（1跳邻域）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (e:Entity {id: 'person_001'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>OPTIONAL MATCH (e)-[r]->(related)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN e, type(r) AS relType, related</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 路径查找：两个实体之间的最短路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a:Entity {name: '张三'}), (b:Organization {name: '字节跳动'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.shortestPath.dijkstra.stream('kg_projection', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sourceNode: a,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    targetNode: b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>YIELD path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN [n IN nodes(path) | coalesce(n.name, n.title)] AS route,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       length(path) AS hops</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"推理查询\">推理查询</h3><p>利用知识图谱的关系传递性回答复杂问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 问题：张三的老板是谁？（间接关系推理）&#10;MATCH (zhang:Person {name: &#39;张三&#39;})-[:WORKS_FOR]-&gt;(company:Company)&#10;      &lt;-[:LEADS]-(boss:Person)&#10;RETURN boss.name AS boss, company.name AS company&#10;&#10;-- 问题：与张三在同一公司的有哪些员工？&#10;MATCH (zhang:Person {name: &#39;张三&#39;})-[:WORKS_FOR]-&gt;(company:Company)&#10;      &lt;-[:WORKS_FOR]-(colleague:Person)&#10;WHERE colleague &lt;&gt; zhang&#10;RETURN colleague.name, colleague.title&#10;LIMIT 20&#10;&#10;-- 问题：张三认识哪些在 AI 领域工作的人？（多跳 + 条件过滤）&#10;MATCH (zhang:Person {name: &#39;张三&#39;})-[:KNOWS*1..3]-(expert:Person)&#10;      -[:WORKS_FOR]-&gt;(co:Company)&#10;WHERE co.industry = &#39;AI&#39;&#10;RETURN DISTINCT expert.name, co.name&#10;ORDER BY expert.name\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 问题：张三的老板是谁？（间接关系推理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (zhang:Person {name: '张三'})-[:WORKS_FOR]->(company:Company)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;-[:LEADS]-(boss:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN boss.name AS boss, company.name AS company</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 问题：与张三在同一公司的有哪些员工？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (zhang:Person {name: '张三'})-[:WORKS_FOR]->(company:Company)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;-[:WORKS_FOR]-(colleague:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE colleague &#x3C;> zhang</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN colleague.name, colleague.title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 问题：张三认识哪些在 AI 领域工作的人？（多跳 + 条件过滤）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (zhang:Person {name: '张三'})-[:KNOWS*1..3]-(expert:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      -[:WORKS_FOR]->(co:Company)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE co.industry = 'AI'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN DISTINCT expert.name, co.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY expert.name</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"聚合与统计\">聚合与统计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 知识图谱统计概览&#10;MATCH (n)&#10;RETURN labels(n)[0] AS entityType, count(n) AS count&#10;ORDER BY count DESC&#10;&#10;-- 关系密度分析&#10;MATCH ()-[r]-&gt;()&#10;RETURN type(r) AS relType, count(r) AS count&#10;ORDER BY count DESC&#10;LIMIT 20&#10;&#10;-- 实体的连接度分布（用于识别中心节点）&#10;MATCH (n:Entity)&#10;WITH n, size((n)--()) AS degree&#10;RETURN degree, count(n) AS nodeCount&#10;ORDER BY degree DESC&#10;LIMIT 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 知识图谱统计概览</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN labels(n)[0] AS entityType, count(n) AS count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY count DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 关系密度分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH ()-[r]->()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN type(r) AS relType, count(r) AS count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY count DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 实体的连接度分布（用于识别中心节点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (n:Entity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH n, size((n)--()) AS degree</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN degree, count(n) AS nodeCount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY degree DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"知识图谱与-llm-集成-graphrag\">知识图谱与 LLM 集成：GraphRAG</h2><p><strong>GraphRAG（Graph Retrieval-Augmented Generation）</strong> 是将知识图谱与大语言模型结合的新兴范式，相比传统向量 RAG 能提供更结构化的上下文：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def graph_rag_query(question: str, graph_db, llm) -&gt; str:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;GraphRAG 查询流程&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    # Step 1: 从问题中抽取关键实体&#10;    entities = extract_entities(question)  # 使用 NLP 或 LLM&#10;&#10;    # Step 2: 从知识图谱检索相关子图&#10;    subgraph_context = graph_db.run(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        MATCH (e:Entity)&#10;        WHERE e.name IN $entities&#10;        WITH e&#10;        MATCH (e)-[r*1..2]-(related:Entity)&#10;        RETURN e, r, related&#10;        LIMIT 100&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;, entities=entities)&#10;&#10;    # Step 3: 将子图转化为自然语言上下文&#10;    context = subgraph_to_text(subgraph_context)&#10;&#10;    # Step 4: 携带上下文调用 LLM&#10;    prompt = f&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    Based on the following knowledge graph facts:&#10;    {context}&#10;&#10;    Answer the question: {question}&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    return llm.generate(prompt)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> graph_rag_query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(question: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, graph_db, llm) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"GraphRAG 查询流程\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Step 1: 从问题中抽取关键实体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entities </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> extract_entities(question)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 NLP 或 LLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Step 2: 从知识图谱检索相关子图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    subgraph_context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph_db.run(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MATCH (e:Entity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHERE e.name IN $entities</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WITH e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MATCH (e)-[r*1..2]-(related:Entity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        RETURN e, r, related</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        LIMIT 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">entities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">entities)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Step 3: 将子图转化为自然语言上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subgraph_to_text(subgraph_context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Step 4: 携带上下文调用 LLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Based on the following knowledge graph facts:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">context</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Answer the question: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">question</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm.generate(prompt)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"wikidata-与-dbpedia-公共知识图谱应用\">Wikidata 与 DBpedia：公共知识图谱应用</h2><p>公共知识图谱可以作为企业知识图谱的基础或补充：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sparql\" data-code=\"-- SPARQL 查询 Wikidata：找出所有中国科技公司的创始人&#10;SELECT ?company ?companyLabel ?founder ?founderLabel ?founded&#10;WHERE {&#10;    ?company wdt:P31 wd:Q4830453 ;    # 实例类型：公司&#10;             wdt:P17 wd:Q148 ;         # 国家：中国&#10;             wdt:P452 wd:Q11032 ;      # 行业：信息技术&#10;             wdt:P112 ?founder ;        # 创始人&#10;             wdt:P571 ?founded .        # 成立日期&#10;    SERVICE wikibase:label {&#10;        bd:serviceParam wikibase:language &quot;zh,en&quot;.&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;ORDER BY ?founded\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- SPARQL 查询 Wikidata：找出所有中国科技公司的创始人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SELECT ?company ?companyLabel ?founder ?founderLabel ?founded</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ?company wdt:P31 wd:Q4830453 ;    # 实例类型：公司</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             wdt:P17 wd:Q148 ;         # 国家：中国</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             wdt:P452 wd:Q11032 ;      # 行业：信息技术</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             wdt:P112 ?founder ;        # 创始人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             wdt:P571 ?founded .        # 成立日期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SERVICE wikibase:label {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bd:serviceParam wikibase:language \"zh,en\".</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY ?founded</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>知识图谱工程是一个完整的系统工程：从数据建模（选择 LPG 或 RDF 模型、设计实体和关系类型）、知识抽取（NER+关系抽取+实体链接管线）、知识融合（实体对齐、去重合并），到查询服务（多跳推理查询、聚合统计）和智能化集成（GraphRAG、SPARQL 推理）。企业知识图谱建设的关键挑战不是技术选型，而是知识质量保证和持续维护机制。GraphRAG 是当前最有价值的知识图谱应用方向，将结构化知识与 LLM 的生成能力结合，能显著提升问答系统的准确性和可信度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章其他文档\">本章其他文档</h2><ul>\n<li>欺诈与社交网络分析：知识图谱构建的关系模式在风控中的应用</li>\n<li>图推荐系统：知识图谱作为推荐系统的语义增强层</li>\n<li>第四章引言：本章三个应用场景的概览和适用条件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"知识图谱应用工程","id":"知识图谱应用工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"知识图谱的基本结构","id":"知识图谱的基本结构"},{"level":3,"text":"基本元素","id":"基本元素"},{"level":3,"text":"知识图谱 Schema 设计","id":"知识图谱-schema-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"知识图谱构建流程","id":"知识图谱构建流程"},{"level":3,"text":"知识抽取管线","id":"知识抽取管线"},{"level":3,"text":"知识融合","id":"知识融合"},{"level":2,"text":"知识图谱查询模式","id":"知识图谱查询模式"},{"level":3,"text":"实体查找与关系探查","id":"实体查找与关系探查"},{"level":3,"text":"推理查询","id":"推理查询"},{"level":3,"text":"聚合与统计","id":"聚合与统计"},{"level":2,"text":"知识图谱与 LLM 集成：GraphRAG","id":"知识图谱与-llm-集成-graphrag"},{"level":2,"text":"Wikidata 与 DBpedia：公共知识图谱应用","id":"wikidata-与-dbpedia-公共知识图谱应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章其他文档","id":"本章其他文档"}],"prev":{"title":"图数据库平台选型：全面对比与决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/platforms/graph-db-comparison"},"next":{"title":"欺诈与社交网络图分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/applications/fraud-social-network-analysis"}}